{
  "about": "The requests cross-seed v6.13.9 sends to each torrent client (src/clients/QBittorrent.ts, Transmission.ts, Deluge.ts, RTorrent.ts), in order, for: signing in (validateConfig), listing the client's torrents twice (getClientSearchees, the second time from the cache), adding a MATCH next to the searchee's files (inject), and, for qBittorrent, adding a MATCH_PARTIAL from linked files with a recheck, resuming it (resumeInjection) and signing in again after a 403. <H> is the searchee's info hash, <HU> the same in capitals, <B> the match's, <C> the partial match's, <F> the .torrent file name cross-seed gives, <T> the torrent in base64.",
